{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoBranchPinned","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoBranchPinned","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRootStructure"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoDeformedSaddle.logSumA_eq_log","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoDeformedSaddle.logSumA_eq_log","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoBranchPinned.lean#L72-L96","doc":"**`Σⱼ log(1 − x·yⱼ) = log x`, from Vieta and the sector bound.**\n\nEvery hypothesis here is discharged elsewhere in this branch: the Vieta\nrelations hold on the curve, `t ∈ (0,1)` and the two `Im` conditions come from\n`exists_pinning_data`, and `x.arg = φ` holds on the arc. This is the statement\n`sum_dVdx_of_pinned` has been waiting on. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoDeformedSaddle.im_logSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoDeformedSaddle.im_logSum","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoBranchPinned.lean#L65-L68","doc":"The imaginary part of a three-term log-sum is the sum of the arguments. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoDeformedSaddle.eq_log_of_branchInt_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoDeformedSaddle.eq_log_of_branchInt_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoBranchPinned.lean#L55-L63","doc":"**And once the integer is `0`, `A = log x`.**\n\nTaken from the *original* equation rather than by recovering the real part —\nthat is what keeps this short. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoDeformedSaddle.exists_int_im_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoDeformedSaddle.exists_int_im_eq","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoBranchPinned.lean#L41-L53","doc":"**`exp(A − log x) = 1` pins `Im A` to `arg x` modulo `2π`.** ","signatureChunk":0}]}